# Wwise Authoring shares an LMDB-backed local database. Concurrent
# WwiseConsole conversions can collide with that database and produce
# LMDB_CommitFailed / WinError 433. Serialize only Wwise transactions;
# FFmpeg/audio preparation may continue in parallel.
